e are looking. You were born Greek and taken as a boy. Now you are camped outside the city your grandmother prayed toward, close enough to count the stones in its wall. What the demo holds The Janiss","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:16:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004180-1844115010501681","game_id":"steam-5004180","kind":"announcement","title":"1453: Fall of Constantinople releases October 28","summary":"1453: Fall of Constantinople releases on 28 October. Constantinople, 1453. Four witnesses — a janissary, a baker's daughter, an engineer, a noble — live the same fifty-three days of the siege. The choices you make cross between their stories, and the city remembers them. It is an illustrated, choice-driven historical novel where every ending is someone's truth. Neither side's ending is the right one. It launches in thirteen languages: English, Greek, Turkish, French, German, Spanish (Spain and L","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T15:16:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501681","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004180-1842212951311059","game_id":"steam-5004180","kind":"announcement","title":"Italian is in the game — and a discussion thread is why","summary":"When this page went up, Italian was not on the language list. On 10 August a player opened a discussion called LINGUA ITALIANA / ITALIAN LANGUAGE. Every comment on it was a +1. Italian is now in 1453: Fall of Constantinople. It ships with the full release on 28 October, and it brings the game to thirteen languages — English, Greek, Turkish, Italian, French, German, Spanish (Spain and Latin America), Japanese, Korean, Portuguese-Brazil, Russian and Simplified Chinese. We are saying this out loud ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T17:52:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004180-1839676055894258","game_id":"steam-5004180","kind":"announcement","title":"1453 is in Steam Next Fest — the demo opens October 8","summary":"Four people are going to live through the same fifty-three days, and none of them will agree about what happened. 1453: Fall of Constantinople will be part of Steam Next Fest, October 19-26, and the playable demo goes live earlier than that — October 8, when the fest's Press Preview opens. If you are new here: this is a choice-driven historical novel told by four witnesses on both sides of the wall. A janissary who was born Greek and taken in the devşirme. A baker's daughter keeping a bread queu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T09:15:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055894258","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5004180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:10:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:10:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5004180":"2026-10-25T22:10:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5004180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:10:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:10:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5037720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:10:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:10:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
